==Description==
The '''Tropical Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 21 of the premium [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{BeachBalls|670}} or {{Robux|57}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|6,760}} or {{Robux|1,445}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|72}} with a total cost of {{Robux|1,817}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|1,492}}.

The '''Tropical Nametag''' green to dark green gradient text and outline. Behind the text, various green leaves and red or yellow flowers appear.

